# Typography showcase – titles, subtitles, paragraphs, quotes, code.

title "Typography in EZHTML"
subtitle "Clean type, automatically."

text "Headings, quotes and code blocks all share the same elegant defaults."
quote "Markup is what you write. Structure is what you ship." "EZHTML"

text "Inline code becomes a styled chip:"
code "ezhtml build file.ezhtml -o out.html"

text "And longer snippets become syntax-highlighted blocks:"
code "fn main() {\n    println!(\"Hello, EZHTML\");\n}" "rust"
